We performed Bland–Altmann and correlation analyses to assess the agreement and association between the wearable system predictions and the gold-standard values. To compare our results with previously reported metrics, we also evaluated the performance of the wearable-system predictions in terms of bias, precision, accuracy, and the Pearson correlation coefficient52. In brief, assuming there are N subjects, for the i-th subject we define \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
